captions = Array[String](["The streets trembled beneath my feet. The nightmare was collapsing...or maybe I was finally waking up.", "The sky pulled everything in...fear, doubt, and every forgotten dream I'd buried under exhaustion.", "Then I remembered...the dream orbs weren't just my way out. They were pieces of me I'd lost along the way.", "When I opend my eyes, the nightmare was over. The sun peeked through the window like it never left.", "Maybe I never escaped the dream...maybe I just found peace within it. "])

